            "mimeType": "application/json;charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 6965,
            "text": "{\"code\":200,\"msg\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"total\":13,\"models\":[{\"model\":\"kling/v2-1-master-text-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling/v2-1-master-text-to-video\",\"title\":\"Affordable Kling 2.1 Master API — Premium Text-to-Video Generation\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":\"Kling 2.1 Master API is the premium endpoint of the Kling 2.1 model developed by Kuaishou. It enables text-to-video and image-to-video generation with cinematic quality, motion fluidity, and prompt precision in 1080p resolution.\",\"pricingDesc\":\"A 5-second video costs 160 credits ($0.80), and a 10-second video costs 320 credits ($1.60).\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.72 for a 5-second video and ~$1.44 for a 10-second video.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v2-1-master-image-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling/v2-1-master-image-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling v2.1 Master API: AI Image to Video API\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":\"Unleash Cinematic Magic: Turn Static Images into Dynamic Masterpieces with Kling v2.1 Master\",\"pricingDesc\":\"A 5-second video costs 160 credits ($0.80), and a 10-second video costs 320 credits ($1.60).\\n High-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.73 per 5-second video and ~$1.45 per 10-second video.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v2-1-pro\",\"slug\":\"kling/v2-1-pro\",\"title\":\"Affordable Kling 2.1 Pro API: Professional Image-to-Video Generation\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":\"The Kling 2.1 Pro is the latest model in the Kling AI series, specializing in image-to-video generation. With enhanced motion simulation, high-quality 1080p output, and improved semantic understanding, it is perfect for professional video production.\",\"pricingDesc\":\"A 5-second video costs 50 credits ($0.25), and a 10-second video costs 100 credits ($0.5).\\n High-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.23 per 5-second video and ~$0.45 per 10-second video.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v2-1-standard\",\"slug\":\"kling/v2-1-standard\",\"title\":\"Kling 2.1 Standard API: Cost-Effective Image to Video Generation\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":\"Kling 2.1 Standard is a high-performance image-to-video model from Kling AI (Kuaishou), offering fast, cinematic AI video generation with 720P quality for creators and developers.\",\"pricingDesc\":\"A 5-second video costs 25 credits ($0.125), and a 10-second video costs 50 credits ($0.25).\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.11 for a 5-second video and ~$0.23 for a 10-second video.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v2-5-turbo-image-to-video-pro\",\"slug\":\"kling/v2-5-turbo-image-to-video-pro\",\"title\":\"Kling V2.5 Turbo Image To Video  Pro\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"42 credits per 5s video ($0.21) and 84 credits per 10s video ($0.42). \\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.189 per 5s video and ~$0.378 per 10s video.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v2-5-turbo-text-to-video-pro\",\"slug\":\"kling/v2-5-turbo-text-to-video-pro\",\"title\":\"Kling V2.5 Turbo Text To Video Pro\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"42 credits per 5-second video ($0.21) and 84 credits per 10-second video ($0.42).\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.19 per 5-second video and ~$0.38 per 10-second video.\"},{\"model\":\"kling-2.6/text-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling-2.6/text-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling 2.6 Text To Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"HD video 5 s no-audio 55 credits ($0.28) / 10 s no-audio 110 credits ($0.55); with audio—5 s 110 credits ($0.55) or 10 s 220 credits ($1.10)—flat-rate about 20 % below the official price.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.25 per 5 s no-audio, ~$0.50 per 10 s no-audio; with audio—5 s ~$0.50, 10 s ~$1.00.\"},{\"model\":\"kling-2.6/image-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling-2.6/image-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling 2.6 Image To Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"HD video 5 s no-audio 55 credits ($0.28) / 10 s no-audio 110 credits ($0.55); with audio—5 s 110 credits ($0.55) or 10 s 220 credits ($1.10)—flat-rate about 20 % below the official price.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to：5s no-audio ($0.25)/10s no-audio ($0.5); with audio-5s ($0.5)/10s ($0.1)\"},{\"model\":\"kling-3.0/video\",\"slug\":\"kling-3.0/video\",\"title\":\"Kling 3.0\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\",\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"Standard: no-audio 14 credits ($0.07) /s ; with audio 20 credits ($0.1)/s;  \\nPro:  no-audio 18 credits ($0.09) / s; with audio 27 credits ($0.135)/s\\n4K：no/with audio 67 credits ($0.335) /s, approximately 80% of the official provider price.\\nHigh-tier top-ups include +10% bonus credits. Effective pricing is approximately 10% lower than the above rates.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v3-turbo-text-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling/v3-turbo-text-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling V3.0 Turbo Text To Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"720P: 18 credits/s (≈$0.09), 1080P: 22.5 credits/s (≈$0.1125).\\nHigh-tier top-ups include +10% bonus credits. Effective pricing is approximately 10% lower than the above rates.\"},{\"model\":\"kling/v3-turbo-image-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling/v3-turbo-image-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling V3.0 Turbo Image To Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"720P: 18 credits/s (≈$0.09), 1080P: 22.5 credits/s (≈$0.1125).\\nHigh-tier top-ups include +10% bonus credits. Effective pricing is approximately 10% lower than the above rates.\"},{\"model\":\"kling-3.0-omni/text-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling-3.0-omni/text-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling 3.0 Omni Text to Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"\\uD83D\\uDCB0 Pricing:\\n720P: 14 credits/s ($0.070/s, no native audio) | 18 credits/s ($0.090/s, with native audio)\\n1080P: 18 credits/s ($0.090/s, no native audio) | 23 credits/s ($0.115/s, with native audio)\\n4K: 67 credits/s ($0.335/s, no native audio) | 67 credits/s ($0.335/s, with native audio)\\n\\nHigh-tier top-ups include a +10% bonus, making effective pricing approximately 10% lower than listed.\"},{\"model\":\"kling-3.0-omni/image-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling-3.0-omni/image-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling 3.0 Omni Image to Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"\\uD83D\\uDCB0 Pricing:\\n720P: 14 credits/s ($0.070/s, no native audio) | 18 credits/s ($0.090/s, with native audio)\\n1080P: 18 credits/s ($0.090/s, no native audio) | 23 credits/s ($0.115/s, with native audio)\\n4K: 67 credits/s ($0.335/s, no native audio) | 67 credits/s ($0.335/s, with native audio)\\n\\nHigh-tier top-ups include a +10% bonus, making effective pricing approximately 10% lower than listed.\"}]}}"
